    {
      "id": "UVhAERHDdQEV-fGR9BJnZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11667.035592485192,
      "y": 10667.533769496713,
      "width": 510.7812253031342,
      "height": 158.41125594359394,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cT1Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 695336777,
      "version": 1515,
      "versionNonce": 1775296913,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792660162482,
      "created": 1791637710056,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这个软件包括生成密钥/地址/挖矿\n\n转账/保存账本/连接其他节点等全部\n核心功能",
      "fontSize": 31.68225118871879,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这个软件包括生成密钥/地址/挖矿\n\n转账/保存账本/连接其他节点等全部\n核心功能",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "B4piXtWAY-k0A5BgFOVDw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11650.998940709263,
      "y": 10919.81843391544,
      "width": 679.4891699112585,
      "height": 118.80844195769544,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cT1R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1256616359,
      "version": 1656,
      "versionNonce": 1228965745,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792660162482,
      "created": 1791638023426,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "私钥：一串256位随机数，控制btc的唯一凭证\n        谁拥有了私钥谁就拥有了对应地址的BTC\n        不能泄露给别人",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "私钥：一串256位随机数，控制btc的唯一凭证\n        谁拥有了私钥谁就拥有了对应地址的BTC\n        不能泄露给别人",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "MjIEJwq8sRrpaxYnGHFwL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11653.932482485998,
      "y": 11078.229689859034,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 79.20562797179697,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cT1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1892243495,
      "version": 1498,
      "versionNonce": 1266708817,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792660162482,
      "created": 1791638113605,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "公钥：由私钥产生，相当于账号，别人可以通过公\n钥来验证签名",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "公钥：由私钥产生，相当于账号，别人可以通过公钥来验证签名",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rDB-o2vjNV5fZYA-RlY7d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11648.065398932533,
      "y": 11233.707404025894,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 118.80844195769544,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cT1T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 172840967,
      "version": 1602,
      "versionNonce": 904404785,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792660162482,
      "created": 1791638172444,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "数字签名: 用私钥对交易内容进行签名，生成一段\n独一无二的密码学字符串，全节点来验证这个签\n名，证明这笔交易是我授权的",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "数字签名: 用私钥对交易内容进行签名，生成一段独一无二的密码学字符串，全节点来验证这个签名，证明这笔交易是我授权的",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
