      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792660162482,
      "created": 1791638256523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "节点:运行btc软件的电脑，节点负责验证交易，保\n存账本，广播信息\n    全节点:保存从创世块到现在的完整账本,能独立\n验证所有交易和区块,比特币网络的“记账员”之一\n    轻钱包（Light Wallet） ：不保存完整账本，\n只保存自己的私钥，需要向全节点查询与自己相关\n的交易信息，方便但依赖他人",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "节点:运行btc软件的电脑，节点负责验证交易，保存账本，广播信息\n    全节点:保存从创世块到现在的完整账本,能独立验证所有交易和区块,比特币网络的“记账员”之一\n    轻钱包（Light Wallet） ：不保存完整账本，只保存自己的私钥，需要向全节点查询与自己相关的交易信息，方便但依赖他人",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BUYXb2hudc3cVmwQ6Mpwm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11647.283088299722,
      "y": 11755.291096119232,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 158.41125594359394,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cT1V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1502359465,
      "version": 1386,
      "versionNonce": 1138542321,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792660162482,
      "created": 1791638422051,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "广播（Broadcast）\n你把签好名的交易发给连接到的节点，节点验证后\n再转发给其他节点，像“一传十，十传百”一样，几\n分钟内传遍全网。",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "广播（Broadcast）\n你把签好名的交易发给连接到的节点，节点验证后再转发给其他节点，像“一传十，十传百”一样，几分钟内传遍全网。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LkK_JDrWH9N78LTAt4Q-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11645.32742362343,
      "y": 11963.57256226729,
      "width": 704.0500264159732,
      "height": 198.01406992949248,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cTKLnNvZ5MVtZd5MUNn5",
      "index": "cT1W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 164142313,
      "version": 1415,
      "versionNonce": 929611985,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792660162482,
      "created": 1791638441611,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "UTXO（未花费交易输出）\n比特币没有“账户余额”的概念，你的“钱”是一堆别\n人转给你、且你还没花掉的UTXO。每个UTXO就\n像一张“钞票”。你要转账时，必须把一张或多张“\n钞票”整个投进去，多余的找零给自己。",
      "fontSize": 31.6822511887188,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "UTXO（未花费交易输出）\n比特币没有“账户余额”的概念，你的“钱”是一堆别人转给你、且你还没花掉的UTXO。每个UTXO就像一张“钞票”。你要转账时，必须把一张或多张“钞票”整个投进去，多余的找零给自己。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
