    {
      "id": "u5rWiyRXrdNwXVfRdW-Z2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -230.37809386917183,
      "y": 10430.896648151038,
      "width": 1260.444539388021,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "AvU8rGzHb0YAiDdivfT-e",
      "index": "cT1pzzzzzV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2041682769,
      "version": 765,
      "versionNonce": 663247743,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792661143602,
      "created": 1792660458939,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "每个节点都可以先根据上一个区块组装出一个候选区块[区块头 + 区块体]\n\n把认为合法的交易从待选池中打包到区块\n\n疯狂的算Nounce值   Hash(Nounce +  区块头)  <= target\n\n算出符合的Nounce后\n\n广播\n\n其他节点收到这个区块后进行验证合法性",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "每个节点都可以先根据上一个区块组装出一个候选区块[区块头 + 区块体]\n\n把认为合法的交易从待选池中打包到区块\n\n疯狂的算Nounce值   Hash(Nounce +  区块头)  <= target\n\n算出符合的Nounce后\n\n广播\n\n其他节点收到这个区块后进行验证合法性",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
