    {
      "id": "r4liizLpcLeGz_EUzBBLa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -98.48920837112519,
      "y": 11150.229788206376,
      "width": 1106.0443674723306,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "AvU8rGzHb0YAiDdivfT-e",
      "index": "cT1pzzzzzz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 568018513,
      "version": 434,
      "versionNonce": 1156008543,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792661076403,
      "created": 1792660987010,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "检查Target是不是符合btc协议中的要求\n\n检查Hash(Nounce + 区块头的信息)  <= target 是否获得记账权\n\n检查交易列表，验证每个交易是合法的\n\n如果有任何一部分不合法那就不能上链",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "检查Target是不是符合btc协议中的要求\n\n检查Hash(Nounce + 区块头的信息)  <= target 是否获得记账权\n\n检查交易列表，验证每个交易是合法的\n\n如果有任何一部分不合法那就不能上链",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
